   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "44822244-a676-3943-92c6-73020219572f"],
 " options are forwarded to each callout. Appearance -> \"CurvedLeader\" is \
supplied by the implementation."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->915518684,ExpressionUUID->"21c473c1-6a5c-1a49-9bb3-0e2277bad35c"],

